<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Palworld</Major>
    <Description>This is a Palworld auto-feed macro that will allow you to stay AFK and not lose your entire health due to starvation.
It's precisely calculated to feed the correct amount of food to avoid wasting. It consumes 7 Red Berries, which is enough to fill 105 food points, but you only have 100. Besides that, it's adjusted to feed once the food bar reaches 4, it takes 32 minutes to reach that point using the standard multiplier configuration (1.0), you can adjust it by changing the time in the last line of the macro, note that in the standard configuration, 1 food point is consumed every 20 seconds, so if you decrease to 0.5 multiplier, now it's 40 seconds and so, if you don't know how much the multiplier is, just count how much seconds takes to decrease 1 point from the bar, and then multiply by 100 and divide by 60, you'll get the minutes to adjust the macro.

Settings used:
Food: Red Berries
Location: Top Left (First Slot of the Inventory)
Resolution: 1920x1080 (if you use another resolution feel free to message me so I can do one for you with the resolution that you want)</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
